class.description:
FmodBank represents a loaded FMOD Studio [code].bank[/code] file. Banks are the primary containers for FMOD content — they hold event definitions, audio samples, bus hierarchies, VCAs, and string tables.

Obtain a bank by loading it with [method FmodServer.load_bank]. Always load the Master bank and its strings bank before content banks.
[codeblock]
var master = FmodServer.load_bank("res://audio/Master.bank", 0)
var strings = FmodServer.load_bank("res://audio/Master.strings.bank", 0)
var music   = FmodServer.load_bank("res://audio/Music.bank", 0)
[/codeblock]
